WEBVTT

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:14.860
I moved to the city this spring to attend design college.

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.990
It's not because I have any real passion for design.

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:23.040
There, done.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:29.170
I just wanted to move to the city
and live like a normal college student.

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:33.300
A hole?

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.610
She saw me!

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:55.570
Shit!

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:02.040
There was no one home when
I tried introducing myself earlier.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:04.250
So my neighbor is a woman?

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:06.870
I guess I can't just go off on her.

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:12.840
I'll just tell her politely that there's a hole in the wall.

00:01:18.680 --> 00:01:21.220
I must remain firm. Firm.

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:29.560
Sh... She's cute.

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:33.400
Uh, I'm Kido and I live next door.

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:35.110
Is it all right if we talk?

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:40.240
Uh, wait!

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.910
Yow!

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:55.210
Crap...

00:01:55.210 --> 00:01:58.130
this now makes me an assailant.

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:05.480
Wh-What are you doing?

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:10.310
What are <i>you</i> doing barging into a woman's apartment?

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:13.230
Give me that!

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:15.740
I'll scream.

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:19.450
I only came to warn you about the hole!

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:24.040
Guess you caught me.

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:28.920
I really like seeing people in their candid state.

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:33.630
I'm willing to erase the photo

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:36.050
on one condition.

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:39.800
My name is Ikuno Emiru.

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:43.810
How would you like to expose ourselves to each other?

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:48.690
Expose ourselves? What?

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:54.110
We each take turns peeping on each other, so...

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:56.190
you take Mondays, Wednesdays, and Fridays,

00:02:56.190 --> 00:02:58.400
and I take Tuesdays, Thursdays, and Saturdays.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:05.450
We must both ignore the fact we're being watched and expose who we really are.

00:03:06.370 --> 00:03:11.500
Look, do you have any idea
how crazy you're sounding?

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:14.130
Is it crazy?

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:17.760
Count me out!

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:20.050
I'm covering up that hole!

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:22.220
Kido-san?

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:25.350
Kido Tatsuhiko-san?

00:03:26.510 --> 00:03:28.980
How does she know my first name?

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:32.730
Don't cover up the hole.

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:35.770
F... Fine, whatever!

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:39.940
We'll start first thing in the morning.

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:47.700
I don't care. She can do what she wants.

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:50.830
All I have to do is act casual.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:54.880
We each take turns peeping in on each other.

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:59.460
According to the rules, it's my turn today.

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:01.880
I'm just checking in on her.

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:04.890
I <i>am</i> living next to some freaky girl.

00:04:05.470 --> 00:04:09.020
I can't rest easy thinking I'm being watched—

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:20.740
No more peeping!

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:23.320
Never! Not for anything!

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:27.240
At least that's what I swore off.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:40.130
Let's do some karaoke! Let's make it a mixer!

00:04:40.130 --> 00:04:41.550
Come with us, Ikuno-san!

00:04:41.550 --> 00:04:43.010
Yeah, come!

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.430
Are you kidding me?

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:49.350
Great! We've officially exchanged contact info!

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:52.600
So you came to Tokyo from the countryside?

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:53.980
Uh, yeah.

00:04:53.980 --> 00:04:56.190
But Yoneyama-kun lives in Tokyo!

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:59.110
I thought you two went to the same school since you're pals.

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:04.200
Me and Tatsuhiko exchanged contacts during a field trip one summer.

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:08.120
But me and Horii met just today!

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:11.160
So you remember me, Kotobiki Yuri.

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:12.120
And she's...

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:15.120
Terakado Makiko. Glad to meet.

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:16.620
