00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:20.290
Still, don't you feel homesick here in Tokyo?

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:22.000
No way.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:26.550
Well, I'll make sure you never feel lonely here, okay?

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:31.430
Sh... She's stacked!

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:36.350
How about we start off with something easy? Can we?

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:36.350
My nose is bleeding...

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:37.980
Then what about Nikugori's "Charan"?

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:38.690
What?

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:42.070
