00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:46.610
I need to use the restroom.

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:49.030
Yeah!

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:49.030
I guess I'll list—

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:55.000
You're not singing, Tatsuhiko-san.

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.500
