00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:08.340
If my neighbor is also my classmate, then I don't want any trouble.

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:11.510
Can't we just forget the whole thing?

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:16.520
Sorry, can't do that!

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:22.730
