00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:29.490
We won't stop exposing ourselves to each other.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:33.370
However, that's where we'll draw the line.

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.290
So, what do you think?

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:38.330
Fine! Whatever!

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:47.340
