00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:37.520
I'll cook us a light supper.

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:38.560
Uh, sure.

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:42.600
Honestly speaking,
Kotobiki-san is just my type of girl.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:46.770
