00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:19.330
Just knowing I was watching you live was very arousing.

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:22.460
Fuck this, I'm done!

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:25.340
Show that photo to whoever the hell you want!

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:26.840
Kido-san...

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:31.550
